      "level": "info",
      "id": "link-redirect",
      "lines": [
        "A link of appinfo/info.xml has moved permanently:",
        "  <documentation><admin> https://docs.nextcloud.com/server/stable/go.php?to=admin-files-access-control",
        "    now https://docs.nextcloud.com/server/stable/go.php/?to=admin-files-access-control",
        "  The old address works only as long as the redirect is kept; the new one can be stated directly."
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "info",
      "id": "node-version",
      "lines": [
        "No Node version is stated: no engines.node, no .nvmrc, and the workflows read node-version from a variable.",
        "  Whoever builds the app uses whatever Node they have, and a build that works on one machine is then not evidence for the next."
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "info",
      "id": "tooling",
      "lines": [
        "Tooling in the checkout: Psalm (psalm.xml), PHPUnit (tests/phpunit.xml), PHP-CS-Fixer (.php-cs-fixer.dist.php), REUSE (REUSE.toml).",
        " No ESLint configuration: nothing checks the frontend sources, so a wrong import is found by the build or not at all.",
        " No Stylelint configuration: stylesheets are unchecked, and a mistake in CSS fails silently instead of loudly.",
        " No EditorConfig configuration: indentation is whatever each contributor's editor does."
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "info",
      "id": "license-drift",
      "lines": [
        "Licence agpl (appinfo/info.xml), LICENSES/ holds AGPL-3.0-only.txt, AGPL-3.0-or-later.txt, Apache-2.0.txt, CC0-1.0.txt, MIT.txt.",
        "  agpl in appinfo/info.xml is a deprecated App Store value, shown there as AGPLv3+, which is AGPL-3.0-or-later. With min-version 35 info.xml can state an SPDX id instead."
      ]
    },
